  "historyNote": "#5789, eff 2-18-94, EXPIRED: 2-18-00 New. #7371, eff 10-7-00; ss by #9216, INTERIM, eff 7-24-08; ss by #9299, eff 10-22-08; ss by #11193, eff 9-30-16",
